            <ArticleTitle>A Syrian man with abdominal pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">bcr-2017-219286</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1136/bcr-2017-219286</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 32-year-old man presented with progressive abdominal pain, nausea and vomiting after swallowing a packet of dollar bills, his entire money savings, during his journey to Europe as a refugee. Subsequent imaging confirmed the presence of a foreign body in his stomach, which required surgical intervention to be removed. This is one of many cases that illustrate the hopeless circumstances people in the Middle-Eastern warzone are currently facing.</AbstractText>
